{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on the Bīraṇa Thicket (Bīraṇathambhavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:0.4"], "en": "7. The Seggu Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:1.1", "PA_ja_217:1.2"], "en": "“The whole world was delighted, for that pig was ignorant of the ways of the village.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:1.3"], "en": "“O maiden, what kind of Dhamma is this for you today,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:1.4"], "en": "that having been seized in the forest,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:2.1"], "en": "you cry out? “That which would be a refuge for one touched by suffering.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:2.2"], "en": "Thus my father acts with malice toward me in the forest;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:2.3"], "en": "to whom shall I cry out in the midst of the woods,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:2.4"], "en": "for he who was my protector now acts with violence?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_217:3.1"], "en": "The Seggujātaka, the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
